# Shared Template Rules

## Project Structure

- `python/` – FastAPI backend
- `react/` – React frontend
- `docker-compose.yml` – One-command run (backend + frontend + PostgreSQL)
- `docs/` – Project notes and documentation

## Database

- **Local dev**: SQLite (default, no setup). `template.db` in `python/`.
- **Docker/Production**: PostgreSQL. Set `DATABASE_URL` (e.g. `postgresql+asyncpg://...`).

## API Contract

- Base URL: `/api/v1`
- JSON request/response
- Health: `GET /api/v1/health`, `GET /api/v1/health/db`
- Auth (when enabled): `POST /api/v1/auth/register`, `POST /api/v1/auth/login`

## Environment

- Backend: `DATABASE_URL` (optional; default SQLite for local), `ENABLED_MODULES`, `SECRET_KEY`, `LOG_DIR` (optional; default `logs`)
- Frontend: `VITE_API_URL` (optional; defaults to `/api` for proxy)

## Production / Optional

- **Gunicorn**: Production ASGI server (e.g. `gunicorn app.main:app -k uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker`)
- **MongoDB**: Optional database; add as module when needed

## Extending

- **New module**: Add `python/app/modules/<name>/` and `react/src/modules/<name>/`
- **Enable module**: Add to `ENABLED_MODULES` (comma-separated, e.g. `auth,basket`)
- **New endpoint**: Add router in `python/app/api/` or `python/app/modules/<name>/`
- **New page**: Add route in `react/src/App.tsx`, component in `react/src/pages/` or `react/src/modules/`
